Communication cards
Bilingual communication cards for foreigners to simplify communication with offices and institutions. The cards contain the most commonly used phrases and a glossary of important terms in the following language combinations: English-Czech, Ukrainian-Czech, Russian-Czech, and Vietnamese-Czech.
